{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034000/extras/b7ae61a42ff1946dd98d8e1b7077c757.avif?t=1762923971\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect yourself as long as you must in <strong>Box of Broken Nails</strong> - a surreal horror experience.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your hammer and nails to board up an unknown door with something breaking out. Find resources around your house and nail down planks in time. <strong>Don't let it open.</strong>\u00a0<strong>No matter what.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034000/extras/ebf9a3b9f2c62ed11ca2505753d37892.avif?t=1762923971\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only this one note, it reads:    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Since I started living here alone, the nights felt endless. I barely remember if my halls have  been this way before. Lately I hear the sounds of my work from behind the walls. The plates are shattering over and over again. I\u2019m just making things up again, am I not? There was never anything wrong with...<br>And\u00a0even if, it changes nothing \u2014 what matters is that I simply must continue and make, make\u2026\u00a0\u00a0 <br>...Make it go away.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No text notes, no audio logs. The story unfolds through the gameplay itself and what it evokes in you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stressful game loop that changes over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unexpected turn of events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034000?t=1762923971","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4034000?t=1762923971","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034000/72e17f7b2b05ff2ccaf5034f48528a8f58db6d64/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762923971","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034000/72e17f7b2b05ff2ccaf5034f48528a8f58db6d64/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762923971","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4080240,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034000/extras/b7ae61a42ff1946dd98d8e1b7077c757.avif?t=1762923971\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect yourself as long as you must in <strong>Box of Broken Nails</strong> - a surreal horror experience.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your hammer and nails to board up an unknown door with something breaking out. Find resources around your house and nail down planks in time. <strong>Don't let it open.</strong>\u00a0<strong>No matter what.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4034000/extras/ebf9a3b9f2c62ed11ca2505753d37892.avif?t=1762923971\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is only this one note, it reads:    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Since I started living here alone, the nights felt endless. I barely remember if my halls have  been this way before. Lately I hear the sounds of my work fro